      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "These electrophysiological studies, using desensitization and selective antagonists, demonstrate a peripheral role of bradykinin in the generation of pain in the rat. In addition, nitric oxide is shown to play a complex role in peripheral and spinal events in nociception."},
